  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SUF - Pilotfasen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3. Huvudfunktioner: (1) Teknisk support till SUF partners; (2) Kopppla ihop behov med finansiering lokalt, reg/globalt/int&apos;l; (3) Packetera projekt och g&#xf6;ra dem m&#xf6;jliga att erh&#xe5;lla fin st&#xf6;d; (4) Utveckla nua finansiella produkter. SUF avser att utf&#xf6;ra experiment i hur man kan skala upp projekt och erh&#xe5;lla privat finsnsiellt st&#xf6;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main functions: (1) Provide TA services to assist SUF partners; (2) Connecting identified needs with local/reg&apos;l/int&apos;l inst&apos;l support; (3) Help with fin. packaging to access financial instruments &amp; make projects &quot;bankable&quot;; (4) Develop existing &amp; new fin. instruments &amp; products. SUF seeks to examine ways to access and up-scale private sector capital to pro-poor urban projects to contribute to MDG11.</narrative>
  </description>
